    // leaves the input's auto-generated id (e.g. Angular's "mat-radio-9-input")
    // as the only usable locator - and that id is NOT stable across page
    // loads, since frameworks like Angular/React generate it from a global
    // counter that depends on everything else rendered earlier on the page.
    // Climbing to the nearest wrapper with short, meaningful text and
    // anchoring an XPath on THAT text (then navigating back down to the
